<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="cs">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Lodě – hra proti počítači</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 24px;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #102033;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #65d9ff;
        }

        .boards {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-start;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 40px;
            margin: 30px auto;
        }

        .board-container {
            width: min(100%, 400px);
        }

        .board {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(10, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 3px;
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .cell {
            aspect-ratio: 1;
            min-width: 0;
            padding: 0;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: #2775a5;
            color: white;
            font-size: clamp(10px, 2.5vw, 20px);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        button.cell:not(:disabled) {
            cursor: crosshair;
        }

        button.cell:not(:disabled):hover {
            background: #4ba9d8;
        }

        .ship {
            background: #718096;
        }

        .hit {
            background: #e34c4c;
        }

        .miss {
            background: #dce7ef;
            color: #263849;
        }

        .status {
            min-height: 48px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .controls button {
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #00a8cc;
            color: white;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .controls button:hover {
            background: #0087a5;
        }

        .legend {
            color: #c6d5e2;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
<h1>🚢 Lodě</h1>
<p>Potop všechny lodě počítače!</p>

<div class="status" id="status" aria-live="polite">
    Připrav se ke střelbě.
</div>

<div class="boards">
    <section class="board-container">
        <h2>Moje pole</h2>
        <div id="playerBoard" class="board"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="board-container">
        <h2>Pole počítače</h2>
        <div id="enemyBoard" class="board"></div>
    </section>
</div>

<p class="legend">
    <span style="color:#718096">■</span> Loď
    &nbsp;
    <span style="color:#ff6666">■</span> Zásah
    &nbsp;
    <span style="color:#dce7ef">■</span> Minela
</p>

<div class="controls">
    <button id="restart">Nová hra</button>
</div>
